url: "https://sparkainlpx.xyz"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic, fully synthetic software replay of GNSS-denied maritime
  navigation (seed 42): nominal GNSS, total dropout, jamming-like noise,
  spoofing offsets, inertial drift and sensor dropouts with labelled events.
  Navigation residuals are mapped explicitly into 16 x 32 OES-512 frames,
  scored through the unmodified pilottrace package with the latch
  S = 0.45 Peak + 0.35 RMS + 0.20 MeanAbs >= 0.50 (fail-closed on NaN, inf
  and bad shapes), and recorded in a hash-based provenance manifest and
  evidence report. Synthetic data only; no physical sensor; no sensor benefit,
  calibration or fitness for operational use is established.
keywords:
  - navigation
  - gnss-denied
